        "phase": '<p class="dmn"><b>Domain 4: Hemostasis/Thrombosis, Thrombotic Disorders, Anticoagulation: Unfractionated Heparin, LMWH, VKA, DTI, and Other Anticoagulants</b></p><p class="T1"><b>4T Scoring for Pretest Probability of HIT</b></p><table class="table"><tr><td class="th"><p class="T2">&#x00A0;</p></td><td class="th"><p class="T2"><b><b>2 Points</b></b></p></td><td class="th"><p class="T2"><b><b>1 Point</b></b></p></td><td class="th"><p class="T2"><b><b>0 Point</b></b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="td_p">Thrombocytopenia</p></td><td><p class="td_p">&#x003E;50% drop or platelet count &#x003C;20,000</p></td><td><p class="td_p">&#x003E;30%-50% drop or platelet count &#x003C;10-19,000</p></td><td><p class="td_p">&#x003C;30% drop or platelet count &#x003C;10,000</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="td_p">Timing of fall in platelet count</p></td><td><p class="td_p">Days 5-10 after start of heparin or Day 1 after exposure if previously exposed to heparin within the past 5-30 d.</p></td><td><p class="td_p">Days 5-10 after start of heparin (some missing counts) or Day 1 after exposure if previously exposed to heparin within the past 31-100 d or platelet falls after Day 100</p></td><td><p class="td_p">&#x003C;Day 4 after start of heparin and no heparin in the past 100 d.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="td_p">Thrombosis and other sequelae</p></td><td><p class="td_p">New thrombus, adrenal hemorrhage, anaphylactoid reaction to heparin, skin necrosis at injection site</p></td><td><p class="td_p">Recurrent or suspected thrombosis or suspected thrombosis but not yet proven</p></td><td><p class="td_p">No thrombosis suspected</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="td_p">Other causes of thrombocytopenia</p></td><td><p class="td_p">No other cause</p></td><td><p class="td_p">Possible other causes</p></td><td><p class="td_p">Definite other causes</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><p class="td_p">Pretest probability score:</p><p class="td_p">6-8: High</p><p class="td_p">4-5: Intermediate</p><p class="td_p">0-4: Low</p></td></tr></table>'
